#: ../../01-quick-start.md:36 6d7f9ec1820e4404b87bf65819f5d993
msgid "01. Quick Start"
msgstr "01. 快速上手"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:40 73091772bc434ee2be2758bc36afddb5
msgid ""
"This page gets you to a first successful OpenResty run quickly, following "
"the official [OpenResty Getting Started "
"guide](https://openresty.org/en/getting-started.html)."
msgstr ""
"本页按照官方 [OpenResty 入门指南](https://openresty.org/en/getting-started.html) "
"让你快速完成 OpenResty 的第一次成功运行。"

