msgstr "仅从源码构建时需要"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:52 12cca7e4cf574694893ce626fb5f447a
msgid "Install OpenResty"
msgstr "安装 OpenResty"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:54 3b6520070b89416aa687090be099634f
msgid ""
"On Linux, use the official [pre-built "
"packages](https://openresty.org/en/linux-packages.html) when your "
"distribution is supported. With the official package, the binary is "
"`openresty`; replace every `nginx` command on this page with `openresty`."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，如果你的发行版受支持，请使用官方[预编译包](https://openresty.org/en/linux-"
"packages.html)。使用官方包时，可执行文件是 `openresty`；请把本页中所有的 `nginx` 命令替换为 `openresty`。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:58 42e171151ce84aceb9600b01b87e3674
msgid "On macOS, the quickest path is Homebrew:"
msgstr "在 macOS 上，最快的方式是使用 Homebrew："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:64 e8ab873efaa146f09390092ac758bac7
msgid ""
"Otherwise, download the [source "
"tarball](https://openresty.org/en/download.html) and follow the "
"[Installation guide](https://openresty.org/en/installation.html)."
msgstr ""
"否则，请下载[源码包](https://openresty.org/en/download.html)并按照[安装指南](https://openresty.org/en/installation.html)进行安装。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:67 47be36e8fe7f4d2bb4fb4d3bb116f1aa
msgid "If `resty` is not on your `PATH`, export it (default prefix assumed):"
msgstr "如果 `resty` 不在你的 `PATH` 中，请导出它（假设使用默认前缀）："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:73 5b9bc97851944aca99cb26998e80ca5c
msgid "Verify the installation with the simplest program possible:"
msgstr "用最简单的程序验证安装："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:80 17c979daf0494e3e901a59ddae53fa67
msgid "Run a \"hello, world\" HTTP Server"
msgstr "运行一个 “hello, world” HTTP 服务器"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:82 825b4c8c6bf04b9ab5760fcc52d46cda
msgid ""
"OpenResty is just an enhanced Nginx, so a working server is a working "
"`nginx.conf`. Create a scratch directory and the config:"
msgstr "OpenResty 只是增强版的 Nginx，因此一个可用的服务器就是一份可用的 `nginx.conf`。先创建临时目录和配置："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:89 a65f3c1110074b6d91c92593d43fb899
msgid "Add `~/work/conf/nginx.conf`:"
msgstr "添加 `~/work/conf/nginx.conf`："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:112 9e27d223e6b345a3a8180d8226895167
msgid ""
"Start the server from the scratch directory (prefix points Nginx at "
"`~/work`, relative paths like `logs/` and `conf/` resolve against it):"
msgstr ""
"从临时目录启动服务器（prefix 让 Nginx 以 `~/work` 为基准，像 `logs/`、`conf/` 这样的相对路径都相对它解析）："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:122 42ee956676c4416d88c5d1575af3c606
msgid "What \"working\" looks like:"
msgstr "“运行正常”的标志："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:124 19ae3e0a9f5741e896c731cdd38d1b55
msgid "`nginx -p ... -c ...` exits without an error and the process stays up."
msgstr "`nginx -p ... -c ...` 无报错退出，进程持续运行。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:125 bed7b71b39a9403283cb546715c55582
msgid "The service answers (in a browser or with curl):"
msgstr "服务有响应（浏览器或 curl 均可）："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:130 d246cf6e236b4a6b8642191d6180ac66
msgid ""
"Errors, if any, appear on stderr or in `logs/error.log` under `~/work`."
msgstr "如有错误，会输出到 stderr 或位于 `~/work` 下的 `logs/error.log` 中。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:132 e1af1581c4c844e1b6b7d6d7bf55b9b6
msgid "Run Tests / Validate"
msgstr "运行测试 / 验证"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:134 8c6a9785f567416d9351441d50e27132
msgid "Basic smoke checks for a fresh install:"
msgstr "对新安装的基本冒烟检查："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:142 3a5bbe67cfa3482b85912cb341055f4c
msgid "Build for Production"
msgstr "构建生产版本"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:144 1102038c9b1b45d9858af7b13a3ea908
msgid ""
"The scratch server above is for exploration only. For a production build, "
"build OpenResty from source (or use the official packages) per the "
"[Installation guide](https://openresty.org/en/installation.html): unpack the"
" tarball, `./configure --prefix=/usr/local/openresty`, `make`, `make "
"install`. Expected install prefix: `/usr/local/openresty/` by default."
msgstr ""
"上面的临时服务器仅供试验。生产构建请按照[安装指南](https://openresty.org/en/installation.html)从源码构建 "
"OpenResty（或使用官方包）：解压源码包，`./configure "
"--prefix=/usr/local/openresty`，`make`，`make "
"install`。默认安装前缀为：`/usr/local/openresty/`。"

